      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town officially became a gated community in 1999, surrounded by country clubs and golf courses like the Bermuda Run Country Club.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bermuda_Run%2C_North_Carolina",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Win‑Mock Farm Dairy earned a spot on the National Register of Historic Places in 2010, preserving a piece of local agricultural heritage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
