      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bermuda_Run%2C_North_Carolina",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 2012, Kinderton Village voluntarily joined Bermuda Run, expanding the town’s boundaries and community spirit.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bermuda_Run%2C_North_Carolina",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Bermuda Run sits on the western bank of the Yadkin River, linking Davie and Forsyth counties across the water.",
